codex
I found a false premise in S6/P5: CSR1 bit 0 also affects which SRAM bytes initialization reads for the mode, MAC address, filter and rings. The repair therefore cannot be recorded as “read-back only.” The detector review also found two omitted red rows in V19’s prediction.
